# Thickness's top half thickens the bass: on each preset (P1 DETTIFOSS, P2 WIDE, P3 FELT) the progression's steps at
# Snap 80 while Thickness rises 0, 25, 50, 75, 100 a step (the bass pair and P1's sub fade in from 50).
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
turn ALGO 80
set 87 0
wait 1200
wav thick-bass-dettifoss.wav
set 87 0 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 25 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 50 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 75 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 100 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 100 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
wavstop
turn PRESET 1
wait 9000
set 87 0
wait 1200
wav thick-bass-wide.wav
set 87 0 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 25 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 50 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 75 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 100 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 100 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
wavstop
turn PRESET 1
wait 9000
set 87 0
wait 1200
wav thick-bass-felt.wav
set 87 0 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 25 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 50 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 75 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 100 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
set 87 100 1500
tapkey 0
wait 3000
wavstop
